_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le12ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         One thing I never want to do, and I see people doing on TV, is diving with sharks! That must be so terrifying! Especially the great white sharks! They're massive! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         I know! What do those people think they're doing?! I mean, I'm all about getting in touch with nature, but that's a little too close for comfort!<br/>", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "20500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         No kidding! I saw this one show about shark diving in South Africa. People get in a cage and go down under the water as people on the surface lure the sharks to the area. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Do you mean to tell me that they go in the water? That must be so frightening! The sharks are in their element there - the humans are not! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Do you know how many people have been killed by sharks? Why would you knowingly swim with them? Some people have too much time on their hands.<br/>", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le12ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "50250", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Do you remember what that show was you watched about the sharks? I'm kind of interested in checking it out.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         I think it was called <span class=\"italic\">Swimming with Sharks</span>. It'll give you nightmares! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         It sounds really creepy, but interesting! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Wow, you must be really obsessed with nature to voluntarily put yourself through that. <br/>", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le12ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}, {"contents": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 2}], "id": 0}]}